     "id": "geneva/ISA.39.1#p1-fab811e2",
     "text": "This was the first king of Babylon, who overcame the Assyrians in the tenth year of his reign.",
     "label": "a",
     "anchor": "Merodachbaladan"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/ISA.39.2",
